\ Seal regression checks using the canonical Foundation-Day final bowls.
\ Run these AFTER the full Foundation sauce mixing test has produced the
\ final bowls and saved visible-drop-46 order.
\ The expected values were independently calculated from sections M and N.
\ There has been no CAL compiler run.

To check the Foundation sealed answers:
  Put 1 into the seal inquiry's bowl identity.
  Put 1 into the seal inquiry's seal number.
  Begin a seal inquiry.
  If the seal inquiry's following identity is not 4,
    put "The seal 1 query of bowl 1 has the wrong successor." into the check report; exit.
  If the seal inquiry's starting answer is not "90411690289794975082828500805689671121",
    put "The seal 1 query of bowl 1 has the wrong A0." into the check report; exit.
  If the seal inquiry's direction answer is not "103408030743865802233775702891907675594",
    put "The seal 1 query of bowl 1 has the wrong D." into the check report; exit.
  If the seal inquiry's answer direction is not -1,
    put "The seal 1 query of bowl 1 has the wrong direction." into the check report; exit.
  Put "922" into a choice width wide quantity.
  Choose a narrow quantity from the choice width wide quantity.
  If the seal inquiry's selected quantity is not "189",
    put "The seal 1 query of bowl 1 chose the wrong number." into the check report; exit.
