\ Validate the circular stream at both ends, including the special
\ SAVE(0)=M convention for a backwards step from 1.
To check the sealed answer wraparound:
  Put "170141183460469231731687303715884105727" into the seal inquiry's current answer.
  Put 1 into the seal inquiry's answer direction.
  Step the sealed answer.
  If the seal inquiry's current answer is not "1",
    put "The sealed answer failed to wrap forwards at M." into the check report; exit.
  Put "1" into the seal inquiry's current answer.
  Put -1 into the seal inquiry's answer direction.
  Step the sealed answer.
  If the seal inquiry's current answer is not "170141183460469231731687303715884105727",
    put "The sealed answer failed to wrap backwards at 1." into the check report; exit.

\ If N=922, L is an exact multiple of N. Rejection of a value
\ above L walks forwards to 1 or backwards to L.
To check the narrow choice rejection:
  Put "922" into a choice width wide quantity.
  Put "170141183460469231731687303715884105727" into the seal inquiry's current answer.
  Put 1 into the seal inquiry's answer direction.
  Choose a narrow quantity from the choice width wide quantity.
  If the seal inquiry's acceptance ceiling is not "170141183460469231731687303715884105506",
    put "The narrow choice ceiling is wrong." into the check report; exit.
  If the seal inquiry's current answer is not "1",
    put "Forward short rejection did not reach the first accepted number." into the check report; exit.
  If the seal inquiry's selected quantity is not "1",
    put "Forward short rejection selected the wrong option." into the check report; exit.
  Put "170141183460469231731687303715884105727" into the seal inquiry's current answer.
  Put -1 into the seal inquiry's answer direction.
  Choose a narrow quantity from the choice width wide quantity.
  If the seal inquiry's current answer is not "170141183460469231731687303715884105506",
    put "Backward short rejection did not reach the acceptance ceiling." into the check report; exit.
  If the seal inquiry's selected quantity is not "922",
    put "Backward short rejection selected the wrong option." into the check report; exit.
